<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens said analyst Dan Niles upgraded Advanced Micro Devices Inc to long-term attractive from market performer.</p>
<p>-- Said AMD's recently reported revenue, operating margins and earnings per share &quot;were higher than our expectations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Raised EPS estimate for 1997 to $1.23 from $1.00 and 1998 estimate to $3.75 from $2.60.  Projects company's K6 microprocessor shipments at 3.3 million units in fiscal 1997 and 14 million in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 43-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
